      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise the veterinary surgeons, emergency clinicians, and intensive care nurses for their high clinical competence and compassion. Reviewers recount feeling reassured during critical moments, highlighting that doctors take time to explain surgical procedures clearly and critical care technicians provide kind, attentive bedside nursing."
