      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clinical feedback reflects widespread gratitude for successful outcomes in severe emergencies, including urgent abdominal surgeries, foreign body extractions, and rapid treatment of young puppies. While one client felt emergency care for a snake bite was delayed by administrative steps, most reviewers credit the hospital with saving their pets' lives."
      }
    },
