      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling during critical hospitalisation"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviews frequently highlight the gentle, loving manner in which hospital staff treat critically ill and injured companion animals. Owners of hospitalized dogs emphasize that veterinary nurses keep pets calm and comfortable in the intensive care unit, providing continuous monitoring and affectionate care that gives distressed families immense reassurance."
      }
    }
